user.description:
Authorize via WeChat first:
1. Copy the WeChat login link below and open it inside WeChat on your phone;
2. Log in to your Towngas account inside WeChat; it will redirect back with a ?code= parameter;
3. Paste the full redirected URL (the one containing ?code=) below — the integration exchanges it for a token automatically.

WeChat login link: {wechat_login_url}

The token itself lasts ~2 hours, but the refresh_token stays valid for days; the integration silently refreshes it every 30 minutes, so no frequent manual steps are needed. {detail}

init.description:
Choose what to manage:
- **Manage accounts**: add or remove gas subscriptions (multiple subscriptions under the same WeChat login can be combined; no re-authorization needed);
- **Adjust intervals**: change data refresh and token refresh frequency.

accounts.description:
Currently added subscriptions:
{accounts}

Choose "Add account" to add a new one, or "Remove account" to delete. Changes take effect automatically after reload.

add_account.description:
Enter the subscription to add (same as initial setup). Multiple subscriptions under the same WeChat login can be combined without re-authorizing.
- subs_id: required;
- subs_code / org_code: optional; required for bills/balance.
